# Public repo boundary (Streamclone Pulse)

This repository is **extension source, portal UI, product docs, and contracts only**.

## Never commit to this public repo

- Production host IPs (`141.11.243.*`, `23.173.152.*`, or similar)
- SSH fingerprints, `root@…` accounts, or private key path names used for production
- Private ops checkout paths, production env file paths, or live env values
- Operator runbooks with host topology or SSH instructions
- VPS deploy/smoke scripts that embed production access details

## Where hosted ops live

**Private streampulse-ops** — deploy, secrets, SSH probes, promotion manifests, soak evidence.

Cross-read streamclone [`docs/hosted-production-ops.md`](https://github.com/Aron-Chu/streamclone/blob/master/docs/hosted-production-ops.md) for the public contract.

## Safe public checks

```bash
curl -fsS https://api.streampulse.stream/v1/extension/health
curl -fsS https://api.streampulse.stream/v1/public/status
```

Local StreamPulse BFF: `curl http://localhost:8081/v1/extension/health`.
`localhost:8090` is watch-only and not an extension or portal BFF.

## When adding docs

Use generic labels: `legacy-rollback-host`, `hosted-production-vps`, `private-streampulse-ops-checkout`.

Do not reintroduce resolvable infrastructure names as SSH/deploy targets.
